Filóre: [The medicine will go bad, and there are many elders at the treatment centers who will be in danger if they don’t take their medicine every day… if this is what it comes to, then we’ll just have to do our best to transport it with our own hands, how about it?]

???: [Eh!? W-with our own hands!?]

Filóre: [That’s right! If the dragon carriages can’t be moved, we’ll just have to carry out the cargo with human strength… don’t you think this could work!?]

