Heinkel: [To start things off, you need to stop plunging in head first, and taking actions akin to searching around in the ashes of a fireplace. You don’t know what’s going to be amidst the ashes, and in the majority of cases, you’re going to get burned. When you’ve got no other choice but to search through the ashes, make use of other people. Starting with me.]

Filóre: [That’s… because you’re an immortal Knight who can’t lose out to flames, Heinkel-sama?]

