As she firmly thrust her finger out at his face, Heinkel reflexively reeled backward. To close the distance which he had opened, Filóre took a step forward. Heinkel stepped back. She stepped forward. Stepped back. Stepped forward. Driving him up against the wall, she thrust her finger right against his forehead.

