Heinkel: [――――]

Filóre: [And so, Heinkel-sama, I’ll listen to your advice as best I can, but I’ll never follow any comments that say I should just look down upon you, or that I should just hide you in a box, that I should just hurry up and throw away such such an alcoholic of a Knight. I hereby declare this.]

Slowly lowering her finger, Filóre brought it down to feel the uniform adorning Heinkel―― his uniform as an official Knight of the Church, which he had been forced to wear given his position as Knight to a Saintess of the Church of the Divine Dragon.

