However――,

Filóre: [But eventually, it will be so that when anyone so much as lays eyes upon these clothes, Heinkel-sama will be the first thing that comes to mind. When that time comes, it’ll be fine for you to make full use of the Church’s influence, and put on airs as much as you like.]

Shutting a single eye, Filóre made a clumsy display of amiability.

