Then, the chance for him to voice any answer, was postponed by the sound of the doors to the chapel opening once more.

???: [――Do you have a moment? There are some civilians getting into a fight right outside the Chuch.]

Filóre: [My, oh dear! We’ll rush there straight away! Heinkel-sama, us too!]

Heinkel: [――. Don’t run. I can’t let you trip and fall, thereby increasing the number of people who’ll need the medicine that’s already short on supply.]

